{"transcript":[{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"You guys have a nice weekend.","timestamp":"00:00:04"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"How was yours?","timestamp":"00:00:08"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It was good.","timestamp":"00:00:09"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It's Thanksgiving here this weekend.","timestamp":"00:00:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So we had a nice like family dinner yesterday and nice day off school and stuff.","timestamp":"00:00:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So yeah.","timestamp":"00:00:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"What day does Thanksgiving fall on for you?","timestamp":"00:00:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Today.","timestamp":"00:00:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Oh, awesome.","timestamp":"00:00:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay, cool.","timestamp":"00:00:24"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I guess I remember that.","timestamp":"00:00:26"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, it is always kind of the same as like Columbus Day, I think here, or Indigenous People's Day, I think.","timestamp":"00:00:27"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Oh, okay.","timestamp":"00:00:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, yeah.","timestamp":"00:00:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But you're going to see Thanksgiving falls on like a, like a Thursday?","timestamp":"00:00:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"It's always the fourth, the fourth Thursday of November.","timestamp":"00:00:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Thursday.","timestamp":"00:00:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:00:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:00:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Ours is always on Monday, but.","timestamp":"00:00:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:00:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:00:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sweet.","timestamp":"00:00:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:00:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Hey, Carmen, do you want to go ahead?","timestamp":"00:00:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yes.","timestamp":"00:00:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"yes.","timestamp":"00:00:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"We can share.","timestamp":"00:00:54"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yep.","timestamp":"00:00:56"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:01:04"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yes, let's see.","timestamp":"00:01:06"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:01:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So not much has changed for DJ Hybrid or Funktastic, but I feel like it will soon.","timestamp":"00:01:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So average cost per lead has been $54.","timestamp":"00:01:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I think it was similar to last week, actually, with like 11 leads.","timestamp":"00:01:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:01:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But yeah, so I think I added this one last week.","timestamp":"00:01:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It hasn't spent too much so far.","timestamp":"00:01:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It's like only been $30.","timestamp":"00:01:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:01:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But yeah, this one, like, it's bringing in the leads, but it's like $60 cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:01:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:01:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"This one is for lead, $35.","timestamp":"00:01:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So yeah, I was like, I don't know if I should pause this, give these more chance to spend, and then like add a new one possibly from their organic.","timestamp":"00:01:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Um, let's see.","timestamp":"00:01:55"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let's just look at, like, what's happened the last timeframes here.","timestamp":"00:02:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let's just see the last week.","timestamp":"00:02:09"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So it's already kind of trending in that direction anyway.","timestamp":"00:02:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"If you look at what it did over the last week, it is pushing more budget and more leads towards this saxophone man one.","timestamp":"00:02:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So it might be better just to let it be and kind of let Meta do what it does best because it's sort of reallocating the budget the way we want anyway.","timestamp":"00:02:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, which is really good to see.","timestamp":"00:02:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I mean, $50 cost per lead is still high, but it's definitely way better.","timestamp":"00:02:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And if the leads are really...","timestamp":"00:02:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like quality leads, then that's, that's okay.","timestamp":"00:03:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Trying to see this ad, but it's not, it's not working.","timestamp":"00:03:04"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Oh, yeah, we changed the headline on this one last time, didn't we?","timestamp":"00:03:09"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"We must have.","timestamp":"00:03:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:03:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sweet.","timestamp":"00:03:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, maybe just pull in, like, leave these on, maybe just pull in one more that's from their organic Instagram and just see how it does.","timestamp":"00:03:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Oh, wow.","timestamp":"00:03:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"That sounds good.","timestamp":"00:03:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And pause the, just the reception one.","timestamp":"00:03:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I don't think I would yet.","timestamp":"00:03:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I would think I would leave it for a little bit longer.","timestamp":"00:03:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Oh, wow.","timestamp":"00:03:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:03:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sounds good.","timestamp":"00:03:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'll just add another one in there.","timestamp":"00:03:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:03:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Good to know.","timestamp":"00:03:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let's see.","timestamp":"00:03:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, so Diamond A Ranch.","timestamp":"00:03:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Fabulous.","timestamp":"00:04:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:04:03"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So it still looks pretty good for me, though.","timestamp":"00:04:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:04:15"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, looks great.","timestamp":"00:04:16"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Love it.","timestamp":"00:04:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:04:31"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Perfect.","timestamp":"00:04:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, sometimes I'm just like, wow, like, under $10 leads.","timestamp":"00:04:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:04:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then, fantastic.","timestamp":"00:04:38"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, they're at, like, $120 cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:04:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"No, it's not good.","timestamp":"00:04:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:04:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Well, what I did over the weekend, or not over the weekend, I think it was Friday or Thursday.","timestamp":"00:04:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:04:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I put, so the two Instagram posts you found last week, I put them up.","timestamp":"00:04:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I put this one up.","timestamp":"00:04:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"How much does it spend?","timestamp":"00:04:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Probably not much.","timestamp":"00:05:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, 14.","timestamp":"00:05:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then I put this one up as, like, in the queue, but I haven't actually published it yet.","timestamp":"00:05:02"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:05:06"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So, yeah.","timestamp":"00:05:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:05:09"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let's just see what's happened in the last, like, seven days.","timestamp":"00:05:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"There we go.","timestamp":"00:05:15"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, that's looking better, though, in the last seven days.","timestamp":"00:05:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:05:31"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then this, you pick the instruments one is the new one?","timestamp":"00:05:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:05:38"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sweet.","timestamp":"00:05:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:05:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I think I would leave it.","timestamp":"00:05:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Um, it looks high over the last 30 days, but it's definitely looking better over, yeah, in the last seven.","timestamp":"00:05:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"That's looking great, so.","timestamp":"00:05:52"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:05:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sweet.","timestamp":"00:05:54"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Perfect.","timestamp":"00:05:55"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:05:56"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Awesome.","timestamp":"00:05:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let's see.","timestamp":"00:05:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then Miss Liz.","timestamp":"00:06:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, because I remember when I started DJ, Hybrid, and Funktastic, like they were at like $24 cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:06:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I'm like, I want to get back to that.","timestamp":"00:06:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:06:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:06:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, I think I refreshed these, not like the past week, but then the week before.","timestamp":"00:06:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, you did the mom planning your wedding, that one.","timestamp":"00:06:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:06:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, added that one in there.","timestamp":"00:06:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I almost wonder if I should turn her retargeting campaign into a conversion campaign, but I also know that, what's her budget?","timestamp":"00:06:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like I think like $3.","timestamp":"00:06:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I think like that wouldn't be effective.","timestamp":"00:06:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I was thinking that last time as well, because what is her cost per click?","timestamp":"00:06:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Cost per click.","timestamp":"00:06:45"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Granted, her cost per click is going to be super low because it's like a traffic campaign.","timestamp":"00:06:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:06:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"What's her budget for retargeting?","timestamp":"00:06:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"$3.","timestamp":"00:06:59"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"$3?","timestamp":"00:07:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I think it's $3.","timestamp":"00:07:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I could like suggest bringing it up to $5 just to test it because I think for Diamond Day Ranch I accidentally made it a lead campaign for their retargeting and it was at $5.","timestamp":"00:07:02"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, yeah.","timestamp":"00:07:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And what is she spending on client attraction?","timestamp":"00:07:14"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Client attraction, that's a good question.","timestamp":"00:07:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like $4 I think?","timestamp":"00:07:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Oh, $2.","timestamp":"00:07:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:07:26"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"She's got such a low budget for Meta.","timestamp":"00:07:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I don't think I would try to run a conversion campaign for less than $3, but you could try it for $5.","timestamp":"00:07:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:07:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, couldn't even like the idea to her.","timestamp":"00:07:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"See what she thinks.","timestamp":"00:07:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, because you're, I mean, even with that, like you're still going to be getting in front of your audience and you're still going to be sending traffic to the landing page.","timestamp":"00:07:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"You may just like.","timestamp":"00:07:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Squeeze a couple of actual leads out of it as opposed to, like, I don't know if any leads have actually come from this retargeting campaign or if we're just sending clicks to our website, right, that are not very intentional.","timestamp":"00:08:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I feel like we're just sending clicks, but I just want to, like, shut up real quick.","timestamp":"00:08:15"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:08:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, too.","timestamp":"00:08:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:08:24"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"The last 30 days?","timestamp":"00:08:26"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:08:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, and that's good.","timestamp":"00:08:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Mm-hmm.","timestamp":"00:08:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"That's surprising.","timestamp":"00:08:32"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"How did she spin?","timestamp":"00:08:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Uh, like, what, two, three dollars a day?","timestamp":"00:08:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So, like, $1.50?","timestamp":"00:08:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"No, it's Okay..100.","timestamp":"00:08:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:08:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Did she get any in the previous 30 days?","timestamp":"00:08:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like, did she get any in, like, the month of September or August?","timestamp":"00:08:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'll just check August for fun.","timestamp":"00:08:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I'm just curious.","timestamp":"00:08:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_i