_invitee_email":null},"text":"And the nice thing when you do it this way, it pulls in all the social proof that's built on this ad.","timestamp":"00:12:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yep.","timestamp":"00:12:31"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"if we just look at the preview on the right-hand side, just to make sure it looks good.","timestamp":"00:12:32"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It looks amazing.","timestamp":"00:12:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"No.","timestamp":"00:12:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:12:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"You just call it testimonial collage or something.","timestamp":"00:12:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So we know it's wet.","timestamp":"00:12:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, perfect.","timestamp":"00:12:56"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then we'll take one of these middle of funnel ads, probably that one with 581 leads.","timestamp":"00:13:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So this one, I'll show you how to do it the other way if you want.","timestamp":"00:13:05"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:13:08"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And sometimes this way is nice when you have like multiple ads to do at the same t