ah.","timestamp":"00:17:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"are looking good.","timestamp":"00:17:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:17:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I think Dos Palomas was the one that was like, maybe there were some red flags about that Victor brought up.","timestamp":"00:17:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So I think as long as we're like launching some new stuff there soon, that we should probably be good.","timestamp":"00:17:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:17:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:17:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"When I looked at, he was late for some reason today on sending the Meta Ads, like recap.","timestamp":"00:17:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I'm not quite sure what happened.","timestamp":"00:17:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"But yeah, what did he say?","timestamp":"00:17:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"He said Dos Palomas leads fell from 15 down to six and that the cost per lead jumped from $7.84 to $19.78.","timestamp":"00:17:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So.","timestamp":"00:17:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So.","timestamp":"00:17:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So.","timestamp":"00:17:59"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um, yeah, I think that that's like the, the only thing that I really saw that wanted to make sure that we can address soon.","timestamp":"00:18:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:18:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Do you want, should we take a look at that account again?","timestamp":"00:18:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let's see.","timestamp":"00:18:15"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I think we just looked at a 30 day window.","timestamp":"00:18:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I was like, yeah, it's looking fine.","timestamp":"00:18:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:18:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It's happened in the last week.","timestamp":"00:18:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"should like, let's just look at it.","timestamp":"00:18:24"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It was Dos Palomas correct.","timestamp":"00:18:27"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:18:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:18:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I always mix them up in Diamond Day and some in Texas Vegas, but that's good.","timestamp":"00:18:31"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Uh, let's see.","timestamp":"00:18:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:18:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"On Meta, they looked really healthy.","timestamp":"00:18:38"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"think it was like $9 cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:18:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I also am going to duplicate that retargeting one and make it into the leads campaign.","timestamp":"00:18:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:18:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:18:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Maybe you just see what it looks like the past seven days so we can see if Victor said was accurate.","timestamp":"00:18:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Hmm.","timestamp":"00:18:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It is.","timestamp":"00:18:59"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I mean, what was the week before?","timestamp":"00:19:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, that's a big jump.","timestamp":"00:19:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I could check if we have like a backlog of creatives that they've approved.","timestamp":"00:19:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I know that they've approved some.","timestamp":"00:19:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I could pause this one since it's like not really spending or I could, should I pause this one since it has like the highest cost per lead and then rotate in a new one?","timestamp":"00:19:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"What are your thoughts?","timestamp":"00:19:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"My thoughts would be to not touch it for another week and just see if it was just like a weird week.","timestamp":"00:19:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And just see what happens over the next seven days if it sort of like stabilizes back out.","timestamp":"00:19:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Because it's only really like a seven day, like what was it the week before?","timestamp":"00:19:55"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"The last one that we looked at.","timestamp":"00:20:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It was like at five to six dollars cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:20:02"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then what was the week before that?","timestamp":"00:20:04"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, five dollars.","timestamp":"00:20:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, this one was 21.","timestamp":"00:20:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I don't know if I should just do another venue collage because like that, that one's getting good.","timestamp":"00:20:15"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, they're just, you know, they're so particular about like, they want to make sure that they've like approved everything.","timestamp":"00:20:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And I think they still have to get back to us on what they want the photos and the new collage to be.","timestamp":"00:20:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And then, you know, they also wanted us to make some edits to some of their creatives that we went over on the call too.","timestamp":"00:20:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So, yeah, I mean, it could just be an anomaly like Jacqueline was saying.","timestamp":"00:20:45"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And since we don't have anything else that's like ready to go to cycle in instead.","timestamp":"00:20:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:20:59"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Because one of these ads, one of the weeks you looked at was like $21 cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:21:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And then I went down to like five the next week, like it kind of bounces all over the place.","timestamp":"00:21:04"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I would be hesitant to make drastic changes and turning things off unless it's like, consistently, you know, climbing and underperforming.","timestamp":"00:21:09"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But I think if we zoom out and look more at like, the month of October, even so far, and how it's looking, we'll just watch it if it's trending in the right, right or wrong direction.","timestamp":"00:21:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But like, I see why Victor like brought it up, like the cost per lead tripled from last week to this week.","timestamp":"00:21:31"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But it still is only $14.","timestamp":"00:21:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And it's still, yeah, I could have just been performance fluctuates.","timestamp":"00:21:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I would probably just leave it for another week and just see what happens.","timestamp":"00:21:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But I'm fine with that.","timestamp":"00:21:52"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:22:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:22:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let me pull up my, showing my screen on green chair.","timestamp":"00:22:02"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"on.","timestamp":"00:22:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:22:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So press record.","timestamp":"00:22:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I saw Victor's last, like, analysis of the purchases that have come through Meta, like that none of them have really attributed to Meta in Shopify, so I don't really know how to optimize the best way, but.","timestamp":"00:23:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, I mean, I don't think it's inaccurate, right?","timestamp":"00:23:24"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Like, I think it could be that people are seeing the ads, they're engaging with the ads, it's just not that they're purchasing immediately from the ads themselves.","timestamp":"00:23:27"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I don't know how else to, like, engineer something to where they would purchase immediately from the ads themselves unless it was some sort of, like, special offer or, like, promo or some things, like, something with, like, more urgency there.","timestamp":"00:23:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um, but I don't know.","timestamp":"00:24:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I mean, I have another, I have a meeting with Steve on Thursday.","timestamp":"00:24:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um, every time we've met and like explaining, you know, why the numbers in Google Ads, uh, look different than inside their Shopify account, why it looks different to their Shopify account.","timestamp":"00:24:05"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And I feel like as long as they're like making sales and, you know, the, the ROAS is good overall, that they're probably okay.","timestamp":"00:24:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um, but I'll see if like the, the sentiment this next time that I meet with him is any different, you know, and then we can kind of go from there.","timestamp":"00:24:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um, yeah.","timestamp":"00:24:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Cause I'm, I'm not really sure what we could be doing differently.","timestamp":"00:24:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"yeah.","timestamp":"00:24:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"this point, like we can't force somebody to purchase as soon as they see an ad.","timestamp":"00:24:52"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I don't know if, does Meta let you change what the attribution window is?","timestamp":"00:25:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Like, if we were to support in the attribution window, could that force more conversions to happen more quickly?","timestamp":"00:25:08"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Does that make any sense?","timestamp":"00:25:16"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yes.","timestamp":"00:25:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"It would make the numbers, like, match up with Shopify more, maybe?","timestamp":"00:25:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Maybe?","timestamp":"00:25:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I actually don't know, like, really a lot about how that works, but I could definitely, like, research and look into that and see.","timestamp":"00:25:27"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"We can also ask Victor, too.","timestamp":"00:25:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, that's an interesting, like, if the attribution window was one day, then Meta wouldn't track a result unless it happened within that day, right?","timestamp":"00:25:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It wouldn't be seven days later.","timestamp":"00:25:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"could go back and be like, oh, we got a purchase, like, a week ago.","timestamp":"00:25:45"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So then it's like, you know, if purchases start to happen in that short window, and then Meta can find more people that are making purchases within that short window.","timestamp":"00:25:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"That's great, but I don't know that that's necessarily going to happen.","timestamp":"00:26:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"It could also then turn into, you know, purchase conversions of $400 each or something like that, you know?","timestamp":"00:26:03"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like it could, yeah, it could backfire at the same time, right?","timestamp":"00:26:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It's almost, with things like this, it's so like, I don't know, I just, I always like to zoom out and just look at like your marketing as a whole, all works together.","timestamp":"00:26:14"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Your ads, your Google, your organic, it all plays together because probably they're going to all three places to look at your stuff and, and then decide to make the purchase.","timestamp":"00:26:24"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So like, as long as it's all working overall, your overall row as is, I think the more important thing to like.","timestamp":"00:26:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:26:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And I think I'll continue to get in the weeds of like Meta bought in three and Google brought in 10.","timestamp":"00:26:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"It's like, right.","timestamp":"00:26:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"A lot of uncertainty between all of your marketing combined.","timestamp":"00:26:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:26:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:26:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"until they, until they start to kind of like push and not say that they kind of have an issue with it.","timestamp":"00:26:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um.","timestamp":"00:26:59"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I don't know that there's necessarily anything that we need to do differently here at this point.","timestamp":"00:27:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I mean, we could try, like, if we were to want to experiment with that at some point, maybe we try a shorter attribution window just for, like, the warm retargeting.","timestamp":"00:27:05"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I don't know if it would let us do that because, like, change attributions at an ad set level.","timestamp":"00:27:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I never mess with that.","timestamp":"00:27:26"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I don't mess with that.","timestamp":"00:27:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I don't either.","timestamp":"00:27:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I don't, I think I'd have to relaunch it.","timestamp":"00:27:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"That makes sense.","timestamp":"00:27:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, but, I mean, I think in the meantime, we can just maybe do a little bit more kind of research, see what we can find out about more e-com strategy because, I mean, this isn't typically what we do at all, you know?","timestamp":"00:27:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:27:55"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:27:56"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:27:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:27:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"That's good.","timestamp":"00:27:59"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Um, Richfield is looking amazing.","timestamp":"00:28:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, they are.","timestamp":"00:28:12"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I just asked Victor, too, like, how things are actually looking in LeadLock, um, like, as far as, uh, you know, tours, consultations, bookings, and there's not really much happening.","timestamp":"00:28:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:28:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So, um, I think I have a meeting with Scott this week, too, so we'll just kind of see how that goes, and I'll update you guys, but, um, you know, I feel like I've been, like, letting him know and kind of harping on with him that, you know, we see the pricing guide as a big area.","timestamp":"00:28:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Grave opportunity, but I've yet to see him make any updates there or actually ask for our help in any way.","timestamp":"00:29:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I don't know that he's responded to like the most recent round of ad creatives that we've shared or my most recent monthly report as well.","timestamp":"00:29:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I still owe him the September report, but he didn't really say anything regarding the August one.","timestamp":"00:29:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So I'll just let you guys know if anything is needed after that call with him.","timestamp":"00:29:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'll go back to them because they don't have their thing.","timestamp":"00:29:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So now that we're tracking leads again, it's looking awesome.","timestamp":"00:30:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"$10 cost per lead.","timestamp":"00:30:06"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"This is just for October.","timestamp":"00:30:08"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Things were a little wonky there for a little bit.","timestamp":"00:30:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"This one, however.","timestamp":"00:30:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:30:14"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So I asked Victor about this earlier today, too, because if I'm remembering correctly, we changed the URL for the retargeting ad.","timestamp":"00:30:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Like we decided to point that one to the LeadLock page.","timestamp":"00:30:32"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And we were kind of doing some testing on the Google ad side as well with the LeadLock page.","timestamp":"00:30:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And just like across the board, our LeadLock landing page like has not been performing well comparatively to their website or to the previous ad traffic landing page that their previous ads agency created for them.","timestamp":"00:30:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Victor did like a little bit of kind of like an audit for us on the landing page and kind of what he thinks we should change, which we can totally do.","timestamp":"00:31:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"But I'm almost thinking in the meantime, it just makes sense to point these retargeting ads back to the link that you were using previously.","timestamp":"00:31:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:31:20"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I would agree.","timestamp":"00:31:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Cause that's what, so these two, the, these bottom two ads, um, are our landing page, right?","timestamp":"00:31:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"If not.","timestamp":"00:31:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:31:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So we're rerunning.","timestamp":"00:31:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Everything is still on then, right?","timestamp":"00:31:38"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"We can just turn the LeadLock ones off.","timestamp":"00:31:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So I'll just turn these ones off right now.","timestamp":"00:31:42"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Let the other two.","timestamp":"00:31:45"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:31:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Sounds good.","timestamp":"00:31:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Also Lauren did reply, um, to an email that we had sent her a while back about some new creatives for her to review.","timestamp":"00:31:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:31:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I'll forward that to you, Jacqueline, because she is wanting to, like, test them.","timestamp":"00:32:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"They're the ones that are speaking a little bit more to the fact that, like, there are specials for the early 2027 dates.","timestamp":"00:32:04"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Oh, yeah.","timestamp":"00:32:12"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, yeah.","timestamp":"00:32:12"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"You know?","timestamp":"00:32:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And so she's like, I'm approving these.","timestamp":"00:32:14"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"However, I don't necessarily like them better than the existing ads that are running.","timestamp":"00:32:17"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So her question is, like, can we test these without, like, turning off any of the other ads?","timestamp":"00:32:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Because I like those better sort of thing.","timestamp":"00:32:29"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So I don't know how you feel about that.","timestamp":"00:32:32"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Because, I mean, I know it's not also not, like, huge budget.","timestamp":"00:32:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So the budget here.","timestamp":"00:32:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"14.","timestamp":"00:32:46"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sorry, remind me, this was the one, like, I wrote new ad copy for this, right?","timestamp":"00:32:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It was, like, some promo where she wants to try and book.","timestamp":"00:32:54"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Mm-hmm.-hmm.","timestamp":"00:32:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Mm","timestamp":"00:32:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"What was it?","timestamp":"00:33:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like wedding season, essentially, like shoulder seasons.","timestamp":"00:33:01"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay, right.","timestamp":"00:33:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'm remembering now.","timestamp":"00:33:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"That was a while ago.","timestamp":"00:33:08"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, and I just forwarded it to you via email.","timestamp":"00:33:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So what she said was, overall, everything looks great.","timestamp":"00:33:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Love the booking incentive info and meta ad copy.","timestamp":"00:33:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"The creatives are great as well.","timestamp":"00:33:26"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"My only question is, will these replace the other ones or just get added in to compare versus the others?","timestamp":"00:33:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I only ask because I do prefer the current ones better in terms of photos slash the actual weddings and aesthetic because I think they are more in line with our ideal client.","timestamp":"00:33:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"But if you're looking to these against the other and run at the same time, I get it.","timestamp":"00:33:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So I don't know like where it could potentially make sense to like layer in more.","timestamp":"00:33:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Are there new creatives that mention this like shoulder season promo or they're just new creatives?","timestamp":"00:34:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I think they were just new creatives that Ivy, because we don't necessarily have to use them either.","timestamp":"00:34:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like we could use, we could use like a creative that's already running and just launch it in its own ad set with this like promo copy just to like run a comparison and like leave.","timestamp":"00:34:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"She's untouched for sure.","timestamp":"00:34:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:34:39"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I think based on what she's saying, we definitely should use the new copy that she's approved.","timestamp":"00:34:41"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'm wondering though, do we have any collage ads running for her?","timestamp":"00:34:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"We don't, we just have a carousel and like videos.","timestamp":"00:34:54"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So.","timestamp":"00:34:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:35:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"For the next round of creatives, then we should definitely ask Ivy to do a collage.","timestamp":"00:35:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I think that'd be good in both.","timestamp":"00:35:08"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But that could work well because we know collages work really well.","timestamp":"00:35:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"That could work well with some of the new copy.","timestamp":"00:35:14"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:35:18"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Well, yeah.","timestamp":"00:35:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:35:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So should I tell her we're going to start testing the new copy, but not necessarily testing the new creatives until we see that, like, there are ones that aren't performing well?","timestamp":"00:35:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Or what did you say you wanted to do as far as the creatives?","timestamp":"00:35:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Well, I mean, if she doesn't love them, but she has approved them.","timestamp":"00:35:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Right.","timestamp":"00:35:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I wonder what she doesn't love about them.","timestamp":"00:35:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like, I just want to make sure, though, that...","timestamp":"00:35:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"The content of these creatives could like pair well with the messaging of these like new ads where we're talking about like shoulder season and you know what I mean?","timestamp":"00:36:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like if these ads are like, I don't know, I guess it would still work, but I just wanted, I just want to see.","timestamp":"00:36:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, I mean, the new creatives don't really have anything to do with the update copy either.","timestamp":"00:36:19"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Right.","timestamp":"00:36:26"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, I mean, this one could work.","timestamp":"00:36:30"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I could use the old, yeah, we could start, if she doesn't love those new creatives, let's get Ivy to make a collage at least for the next round.","timestamp":"00:36:32"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"You could use these creatives, but just change up the copy and the headline and launch it in its own ad set and just run it as a test alongside these existing ads.","timestamp":"00:36:38"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, what I get from what she was saying is that she doesn't necessarily like the...","timestamp":"00:36:49"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"She just doesn't like the aesthetic of what couples and what weddings were like chosen for this newest round of creatives.","timestamp":"00:37:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"She says the current ones, she likes them better in terms of the photos, the actual weddings, and the aesthetic because I think they are more in line with our ideal client.","timestamp":"00:37:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:37:22"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Got it.","timestamp":"00:37:23"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:37:25"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:37:27"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"We use what we have, switch out the copy with the profile.","timestamp":"00:37:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"See how it goes.","timestamp":"00:37:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'll launch them in form as well.","timestamp":"00:37:36"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:37:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:37:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Their ads are killing it.","timestamp":"00:37:54"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"They're looking, I know.","timestamp":"00:37:56"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I'm like, are these legit?","timestamp":"00:37:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"It's like I need to like, I asked earlier today and he said that they are, he said that it matches what's in LeadLock and that three tours have booked from the Meta ads already.","timestamp":"00:38:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"What?","timestamp":"00:38:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Fabulous.","timestamp":"00:38:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:38:13"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Jacqueline Hood","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Sweet.","timestamp":"00:38:15"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I'm just curious.","timestamp":"00:38:16"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"hello@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"And then their, what's it called?","timestamp":"00:38:18"},{